{
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "운영자 수동 정책 버전 발행 모달 — memo 입력 + POST /admin/policy-versions"
    },
    "comment": "정책 버전 발행 창 — 환경설정에서만 쓴다. 발행 즉시 적용되고 전 회원이 재동의 대상이 되므로 영향 안내를 함께 싣는다",
    "id": "policy_version_publish_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.title",
        "size": "medium"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "gdpr:space-y-3 gdpr:text-sm gdpr:text-gray-700 gdpr:dark:text-gray-200"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "comment": "사용자 영향 안내 — amber 좌측 색띠 + circle-exclamation — 「발행 시 즉시 적용 + 전 회원 재동의」 라는 점을 명확히 강조",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "gdpr:bg-amber-50 gdpr:dark:bg-gray-900 gdpr:border gdpr:border-amber-200 gdpr:dark:border-gray-700 gdpr:border-l-4 gdpr-accent-warning gdpr:rounded-lg gdpr:p-3 gdpr-flex-center gdpr:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "circle-exclamation",
                                "size": "sm",
                                "className": "gdpr:text-amber-600 gdpr:dark:text-amber-400 gdpr:flex-shrink-0"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "gdpr:text-sm gdpr:text-gray-800 gdpr:dark:text-gray-100 gdpr:leading-relaxed"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.body"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Ul",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "gdpr:list-disc gdpr:list-inside gdpr:text-xs gdpr:text-gray-600 gdpr:dark:text-gray-300 gdpr:space-y-1 gdpr:pl-1"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Li",
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.effect_bump"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Li",
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.effect_reconsent"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Li",
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.effect_history"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "gdpr:pt-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "gdpr:block gdpr:text-xs gdpr:font-medium gdpr:text-gray-700 gdpr:dark:text-gray-300 gdpr:mb-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.memo_label"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Textarea",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "발행 메모 — 무엇이 바뀌어 새 버전을 냈는지 남기는 자리다(이력 표에 그대로 보인다)",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "publishMemo": "{{$event?.target?.value ?? ''}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "name": "publish_memo",
                                "rows": 3,
                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.memo_placeholder",
                                "value": "{{_local.publishMemo ?? ''}}",
                                "className": "gdpr-text-primary gdpr:w-full gdpr:px-3 gdpr:py-2 gdpr:border gdpr:border-gray-300 gdpr:dark:border-gray-600 gdpr:rounded-lg gdpr:bg-white gdpr:dark:bg-gray-700 gdpr:text-sm gdpr:focus:ring-2 gdpr:focus:ring-blue-500 gdpr:dark:focus:ring-blue-400 gdpr:focus:border-blue-500 gdpr:dark:focus:border-blue-400",
                                "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isPluginReadOnly}}"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "gdpr:flex gdpr:justify-end gdpr:gap-2 gdpr:pt-3 gdpr:border-t gdpr:border-gray-200 gdpr:dark:border-gray-700 gdpr:mt-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "closeModal"
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "disabled": "{{_local.isPublishing}}",
                                "className": "gdpr:px-4 gdpr:py-2 gdpr:bg-gray-100 gdpr:dark:bg-gray-700 gdpr:text-gray-700 gdpr:dark:text-gray-200 gdpr:rounded-lg gdpr:text-sm gdpr:font-medium gdpr:hover:bg-gray-200 gdpr:dark:hover:bg-gray-600 gdpr:transition-colors gdpr:disabled:opacity-50 gdpr:disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "발행 확정 — isPublishing 플래그로 발행 동안 스피너 노출 + 양쪽 버튼 disabled. closeModal 을 sequence 마지막에서 onSuccess 로 이동 (이전: 클릭 즉시 닫혀서 사용자가 발행 진행 상태 파악 불가). 발행 실패 시 모달 유지 → memo 수정 후 재시도 가능.",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "isPublishing": true
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "apiCall",
                                            "target": "/api/plugins/sirsoft-gdpr/admin/policy-versions",
                                            "auth_required": true,
                                            "params": {
                                                "method": "POST",
                                                "body": "{{({memo: _local.publishMemo ?? ''})}}"
                                            },
                                            "onSuccess": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "isPublishing": false,
                                                        "publishMemo": ""
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "dataSourceId": "gdprPolicyVersionCurrent"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "dataSourceId": "gdprPolicyVersionHistory"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "closeModal"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "toast",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "type": "success",
                                                        "message": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.publish_success"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "onError": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "isPublishing": false
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "toast",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "type": "error",
                                                        "message": "{{Object.values(error.errors ?? {})[0]?.[0] ?? '$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.save_error'}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "disabled": "{{$parent._computed.isPluginReadOnly || (!(_local.publishMemo ?? '').trim() || _local.isPublishing)}}",
                                "className": "gdpr:px-4 gdpr:py-2 gdpr:bg-gray-900 gdpr:dark:bg-white gdpr:text-white gdpr:dark:text-gray-900 gdpr:rounded-lg gdpr:text-sm gdpr:font-medium gdpr:hover:bg-gray-800 gdpr:dark:hover:bg-gray-100 gdpr:transition-colors gdpr:disabled:opacity-50 gdpr:disabled:cursor-not-allowed gdpr:inline-flex gdpr:items-center"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "if": "{{_local.isPublishing}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "spinner",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "spin": true,
                                        "className": "gdpr:mr-1"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{!_local.isPublishing}}",
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.material_modal.confirm"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{_local.isPublishing}}",
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-gdpr.settings.policy_version.publishing"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
